  "description": "API 312 family signal path from the CAPI VP312-VPR Rev A schematic, with the pad off, normal polarity and full output. Includes vendor-derived AP2520 gain, bandwidth and slew. The 1:8 input and 1:2 output transformer ratios are retained with approximate linear winding parameters. The input has a 150 \u03a9 source resistance and the output has a 600 \u03a9 load. Phantom power, switching and output fader circuitry are omitted.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
  "layout": {
    "pots": [
      "Gain"
    ]
  },
  "name": "API 312 Preamp VP312 Rev A",
